  "id": "gamma-wave",
  "term": "gamma wave",
  "definition": "A gamma wave is a pattern of brain activity measured with EEG in the gamma frequency band. In this source, higher gamma activity during speaking tasks was associated with greater attentional focus and semantic processing, though it did not clearly separate lower- and higher-performing speakers.",
